          {
            "name": "Divided Loyalties",
            "id": "62a0-3096-ade2-91f6",
            "description": "If Lydia wishes to target an enemy Alpha or Carl Grimes with an attack, or if Alpha or Carl Grimes wish to target Lydia, the attacking model must first roll a Shield on the action die. On a blank, the attacker must choose a different target, or a different action.",
